---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro'
import { flagGroups, subcommands } from '../../data/cliFlags'

const toc = [
  { id: 'usage', label: '用法' },
  ...flagGroups.map(g => ({ id: g.id, label: g.label })),
  { id: 'subcommands', label: '子命令' },
]
---

<DocsLayout
  title="openclaude CLI 参考 — flags 与子命令"
  description="openclaude 命令行完整参考：所有 flag（model、I/O formats、sessions、permissions、MCP）以及 mcp、ssh 等子命令。"
  heading="CLI 参考"
  lede="openclaude binary 的所有已记录 flag，按用途分组。会话内部输入的斜杠命令另有单独文档。"
  toc={toc}
>
  <h2 id="usage">用法</h2>
  <pre><code>openclaude [options] [prompt]

# 当前仓库中的交互式会话
openclaude

# 非交互式：打印结果并退出
openclaude -p "explain the build pipeline" --output-format json</code></pre>
  <p>
    想找会话内输入的 <code>/commands</code>？请看
    <a href="/docs/slash-commands/">斜杠命令参考</a>。
  </p>

  {flagGroups.map(group => (
    <section>
      <h2 id={group.id}>{group.label}</h2>
      {group.intro && <p>{group.intro}</p>}
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">flag</th>
              <th scope="col">说明</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {group.flags.map(f => (
              <tr>
                <td><code>{f.flag}{f.arg ? ` ${f.arg}` : ''}</code></td>
                <td>{f.description}</td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>
  ))}

  <h2 id="subcommands">子命令</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">子命令</th>
          <th scope="col">说明</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {subcommands.map(s => (
          <tr>
            <td><code>{s.usage}</code></td>
            <td>{s.description}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    大多数 flag 的默认值都可以持久化到 settings 文件中；详见
    <a href="/docs/configuration/">配置</a>。
  </p>
</DocsLayout>
